{
  "$comment": "Golden cases for the GST split. Every amount here was worked out by hand from the rule — rate applied once at full precision, line tax rounded once at money scale, then allocated across components — so the file is a statement of what the rule *is*, not a recording of what the code did. Changing the split, the halving, the rounding point or the order of the summary must fail one of these.",
